msgctxt "9692"
msgid "Score Some Leads!"
msgstr "¡Obtén números de teléfono!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "9696"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "72_Lame Scout"
msgid "Harder than you remembered, eh, boss?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal el trabajo, jefecito?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "84_Akiyama"
msgid "We'll see about that..."
msgstr "Veamos, los resultados..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "96_Lame Scout"
msgid "See? I knew you were all talk! This doesn't make you look\\r\ngood, boss."
msgstr "¿Lo ve? ¡Sabía que era puro blablabla! Esto no lo deja bien, jefe."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "108_Akiyama"
msgid "There just weren't enough people out there today!\\r\nOrdinarily, I'd pull in way more leads."
msgstr "¡Parece que hoy no había mucha gente fuera! Lo normal es que hubieran picado más chicas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "120_Lame Scout"
msgid "Sure, sure. Whatever helps you sleep at night..."
msgstr "Uy sí, lo que usted diga."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "132_Akiyama"
msgid "You're really starting to piss me off you know that...?"
msgstr "Ya te estás pasando un poco de la raya..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "144_Lame Scout"
msgid "Seriously, though, boss, for you to get out there like that\\r\nfor my sake? That's pret-ty awesome."
msgstr "Pero hablando en serio, que usted se haya tomado la molestia de hacer todo esto por alguien como yo me ha conmovido."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "156_Lame Scout"
msgid "I think I'll stay in the game a little longer."
msgstr "Creo que seguiré intentándolo por un rato más."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "168_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, yeah? Good to hear. And this time, be sure to work\\r\nhard, okay?"
msgstr "¿De verdad? Me alegro. Y esta vez asegúrate de dar el máximo, ¿de acuerdo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "180_Lame Scout"
msgid "You bet!"
msgstr "¡Claro que sí!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "192_Akiyama"
msgid "(I guess it turned out all right after all.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que todo salió bien al final...)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "276_Lame Scout"
msgid "Whoa! You managed to get three leads? In only five minutes!?"
msgstr "¡Wow! ¡¿Consiguió tres chicas en solo cinco minutos?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "288_Lame Scout"
msgid "Whoa! You managed to get four leads? In only five minutes!?"
msgstr "¡Wow! ¡¿Consiguió cuatro chicas en solo cinco minutos?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "300_Lame Scout"
msgid "Whoa! Five leads!? That's a lead a minute!"
msgstr "¡Wow! ¡¿Cinco chicas?! ¡Eso es una por minuto!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "312_Akiyama"
msgid "Heheh. I could've done even better if I were younger."
msgstr "Je, je, je. Ni modo. Supongo que los años pesan."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "324_Lame Scout"
msgid "Wow, boss, you really meant business out there! Now you've\\r\ngot me all motivated, too."
msgstr "¡Wow, jefecito! ¡De verdad fue en serio! Me siento súper motivado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "336_Lame Scout"
msgid "I'm gonna go and give it everything I've got!"
msgstr "¡De ahora en adelante voy a dar lo mejor de mí!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "348_Akiyama"
msgid "Excellent. That's all I ask. Good luck."
msgstr "Excelente, eso es todo lo que te pido.\n¡Buena suerte!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "360_Lame Scout"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "¡Sí, señor!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "372_Akiyama"
msgid "(Heh...)"
msgstr "(Je...)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "384_Akiyama"
msgid "(And the bossman emerges with dignity intact!)"
msgstr "(¡Y el jefe emerge con su dignidad intacta!)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "480_Akiyama"
msgid "The First Rule of Scouting: \"Never let a girl pass you by.\""
msgstr "Primera regla de cómo ser un reclutador: \"No dejes que ninguna chica pase de largo de ti\"."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "492_Akiyama"
msgid "You've been standing around all day with only one lead to\\r\nshow for it, proof positive you've been playing hooky\\r\ninstead of working."
msgstr "Estuviste parado todo el día y solo conseguiste una chica, es prueba suficiente de que te estuviste holgazaneando en lugar de trabajar."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "504_Lame Scout"
msgid "...Look, you can talk the talk, boss, and I see what you're\\r\nsaying, I do. But can you walk the walk? How good are you,\\r\nreally?"
msgstr "...Entiendo lo que trata de decir, jefe, pero ¿puede respaldarlo con hechos? ¿Qué tan buen reclutador es en realidad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "516_Lame Scout"
msgid "You seem confident enough, so I guess you were probably\\r\nreally something at one point. Still, I get the feeling your\\r\nskills are pretty rusty."
msgstr "Parece bastante seguro de sí mismo, así que supongo que fue impresionante en el pasado. Sin embargo, presiento que sus trucos están oxidados."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "528_Akiyama"
msgid "You really want to go there? Okay, give me five minutes to\\r\ndo some scouting of my own, then."
msgstr "¿De verdad quieres llegar a eso? Bueno, entonces me dedicaré los próximos cinco minutos a reclutar chicas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "540_Akiyama"
msgid "You tell me how many leads I should score in that amount of\\r\ntime."
msgstr "Vamos, vamos, dime cuántas chicas quieres que consiga en ese tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "552_Lame Scout"
msgid "Seriously!? Well, gee, I dunno! I'm kinda clueless when it\\r\ncomes to this stuff."
msgstr "¡¿De verdad?! ¡Pues no tengo idea! Soy de esos tipos que no saben nada de estas cosas..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "564_Akiyama"
msgid "I noticed."
msgstr "Sí, ya me di cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "576_Lame Scout"
msgid "Ouch. Fine. All right, if that's the way you're gonna be,\\r\nthen I'm not holding back..."
msgstr "Ay... Conque así quiere que sea, entonces no me contendré..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "588_Lame Scout"
msgid "How about... three times the leads I pulled in? That's three\\r\npeople! You need three leads to win!"
msgstr "Qué le parece... ¡Tres veces más chicas que las que conseguí! ¡Eso da un total de tres chicas! ¡Necesita a tres chicas para ganar!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "600_Akiyama"
msgid "Fine. But why three, particularly?"
msgstr "Me parece bien. Pero, ¿por qué tres?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "612_Lame Scout"
msgid "Because a real master ought to be able to do three times better than a normal person, right?"
msgstr "Porque un profesional suele hacerlo tres veces mejor que alguien promedio, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "624_Akiyama"
msgid "Whatever you say. Okay, then, here I go. Clock starts now!"
msgstr "No entiendo del todo, pero está bien. Entonces, aquí voy. ¡Dale al cronómetro!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "636_Score Some Leads!"
msgid "In the next five minutes, talk to as many women as possible and ask for their phone numbers (i.e., get leads). Do keep in mind, however, that you're scouting specifically for hostesses."
msgstr "En los próximos cinco minutos, habla con tantas mujeres como puedas y trata de conseguir sus números de teléfono (o sea, para programar citas). Ten en cuenta que estás buscando específicamente chicas para que sean hostesses."

